  vendorName: Merchant Whitmore
  offerText: I am selling off my stockpiles of heavy winter coal at a premium. It
    will severely clutter your room, but the cold season is approaching fast.
  acceptResultText: The massive piles of coal ruin your floor space, but you are
    prepared for whatever comes.
  rejectResultText: You decline the dirty coal, preferring your clean and spacious
    room. It's not even that cold out, right?
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: A sudden, catastrophic blizzard hits the city! Without Whitmore's
    coal, your room turns into a freezing icebox. You are violently shivering and
    fall ill.
